/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1266 0 R
/E (Automatic state injection: The syntax eliminate manual `HandoffInputData` objects and `to_input_list\(\)` calls, making data flow between agents seamless and reducing error-prone state transformations by automatically capturing and injecting agent outputs.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
586 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1267 0 R
/E (Built in Orchestration: The SequentialAgent provides deterministic execution with framework-managed error handling, retry logic, and observability features, eliminating the need for custom async/await coordination)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
587 0 obj
